{"content":"{\"chapter_contract_id\":\"contract:v2-n-3-2-1:v2\",\"node_id\":\"v2_n_3_2_1\",\"schema_version\":\"ordered_chapter_draft_candidate.v1\",\"known_evidence_ids\":[\"evidence:source:b1d9ad239a9b5caac9aa829d31d627f38db2df2d7505c034163803cca089e22a\",\"evidence:source:77fcc399b93a751e666f00fa7a1c23fe5966fac87042d576d4c39adc384226c0\",\"evidence:source:9e2e17d609b2e2e8d61f45b9aa630042e87e5c1e3fbfa74f023cad3783db0081\",\"evidence:source:5b3aa77ddd0e596a38e3f76192a3d79dcbeb77469a2258d9aa6e06fc3de69cd8\",\"evidence:source:97bed8108bac56a5c29e10f868e9760ed3d2ac8a67e4e3846c8aeb6718dd098e\",\"evidence:source:5f24a7eb6e284afdaa11c3944a1b46ccb73a2598c81de673ddb4ede130b2a172\"],\"blocks\":[{\"block_id\":\"block:v2_n_3_2_1:heading\",\"kind\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"3.2.1 次要目的\",\"evidence_refs\":[]},{\"block_id\":\"block:v2_n_3_2_1:intro\",\"kind\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"本章应逐项列明次要目的，并将每一项目的映射至已定义的次要终点；每条次要目的均应采用可核验的客观陈述，不得以编号占位或模板示例代替。已确认研究事实中尚未登记任何次要目的，故以下映射表以缺口标注呈现，待研究团队确认后补充。\",\"evidence_refs\":[]},{\"block_id\":\"block:v2_n_3_2_1:table:secondary_objective_endpoint_map\",\"kind\":\"table\",\"evidence_refs\":[],\"table\":{\"table_id\":\"tbl:v2_n_3_2_1:secondary_objective_endpoint_map\",\"block_id\":\"block:v2_n_3_2_1:table:secondary_objective_endpoint_map\",\"role\":\"body_content\",\"domain\":\"objectives_endpoints\",\"title\":\"次要目的—次要终点映射表\",\"header_row_count\":1,\"review_state\":\"ai_draft\",\"schema_version\":\"structured_table_v1\",\"version\":0,\"columns\":[{\"column_id\":\"secondary:col:objective\",\"label\":\"次要目的\",\"order\":0,\"semantic_role\":\"objective\",\"style_role\":\"header\"},{\"column_id\":\"secondary:col:endpoint\",\"label\":\"对应次要终点\",\"order\":1,\"semantic_role\":\"endpoint\",\"style_role\":\"header\"},{\"column_id\":\"secondary:col:multiplicity_intent\",\"label\":\"统计推断定位/多重性意图\",\"order\":2,\"semantic_role\":\"multiplicity_intent\",\"style_role\":\"header\"}],\"rows\":[{\"row_id\":\"secondary:row:1\",\"order\":0,\"cells\":[{\"cell_id\":\"